  message: "2026-11-24 docstring audit (dev 7e204b35b): the C++ #if-in-class-body gap is wider than the missing field symbol. _cpp_member_dispatch_meta, _emit_cpp_field_symbols and _cpp_has_pure_virtual all walk only body.children (cpp.py:1123-1125, 1191-1196, 353-357), so `#ifdef FAST virtual void fast(); int guarded_field; #endif` gives no virtual_members entry and no G::guarded_field, and a pure virtual in such a block does not make the class abstract. _CPP_MEMBER_WRAPPERS (cpp.py:888) already treats a #if block as in-body. One fix (walk through preproc blocks) covers all three. r20, v04."  # 265d
